  "exam": {
    "about": "100% fresh, zero static benchmarks, zero synthetic templates, zero raw web-text perplexity. The official score is 100% fresh harvest-derived multi-sentence reasoning (explain, infer, synthesis — one-third each, written once at the draw at temp=0 by pinned thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini with reasoning_effort=low from three fresh hours of the day before, with varied wrappers and an anti-copying filter, and published in full at settlement), all sat after a brief disjoint multilingual SFT probe. Four fresh human-written twin-context comprehension kinds (reference, news, technical, conversation) from those same three hours are sat alongside at 0% score weight as published diagnostic telemetry until a human-written measure passes DataDecide.",
    "generator_version": 11,
    "per_corner": 0,
